(i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron).","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This utility helps to define wether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"}]}}}